          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1504504",
      "subQuestName": "Return to the resort accommodation and rest",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150450401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150450401": {
            "id": "150450401",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "#Morning {NICKNAME}, morning Paimon! Thought I'd come over and say hi, puffer floaters and all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450402"
            ]
          },
          "150450402": {
            "id": "150450402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Morning, Mualani! How are you so full of energy? Weren't you the one partying the hardest last night!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450403"
            ]
          },
          "150450403": {
            "id": "150450403",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "That was last night! I got a good night's sleep, and now I'm good as new!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450404"
            ]
          },
          "150450404": {
            "id": "150450404",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "Here, take this. It's your prize for completing the album — I picked yours up too, to save you the trip!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450405"
            ]
          },
          "150450405": {
            "id": "150450405",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow! Thanks, Mualani! That was so nice!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450406"
            ]
          },
          "150450406": {
            "id": "150450406",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "When it comes to helping people, a good guide always thinks one step ahead, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450407"
            ]
          },
          "150450407": {
            "id": "150450407",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "Oh, and speaking of work, I guess our vacation's almost over, huh... Probably for the best. If I don't head back soon, I'm worried my little doggie won't even remember me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450408"
            ]
          },
          "150450408": {
            "id": "150450408",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "And after talking to the others, it seems like everyone is just about ready to get back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450409"
            ]
          },
          "150450409": {
            "id": "150450409",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "Some are missing their families, others are going through Dandelion Wine withdrawal, I guess...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450410"
            ]
          },
          "150450410": {
            "id": "150450410",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "Even Chasca seems to be feeling it. Not that she'd ever admit it, but I have noticed her gazing back towards the Flower-Feather Clan at night.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450411"
            ]
          },
          "150450411": {
            "id": "150450411",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I completely understand...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450412"
            ]
          },
          "150450412": {
            "id": "150450412",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "But summer's not over yet! So I say... we squeeze a few more unforgettable moments into the time we've got left!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450413"
            ]
          },
          "150450413": {
            "id": "150450413",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "Like another group photo!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450414"
            ]
          },
          "150450414": {
            "id": "150450414",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, how about taking one right here? After all this time, Paimon's grown kind of attached to this place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150450415"
            ]
          },
          "150450415": {
            "id": "150450415",
            "speakerId": 1087,
            "speakerName": "Mualani",
            "text": "Great idea! Why don't you spruce up this wall, and I'll go gather the others. See you over at the plaza!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
